		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hint_up_01">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>え？　ボストレーナーなら
うえのかいで　みたよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-14T08:01:26" />
